<div class="panel demo">
  <div class="flow">
    <div class="fb"><b>Token embedding</b><span>ID → list of numbers (a lookup table)</span></div>
    <div class="blk"><span class="tag">repeated 30 to over 120 times</span>
      <div class="fb att"><b>Attention</b><span>words share information with earlier words</span></div>
      <div class="plus">+ added onto the running vector</div>
      <div class="fb mlp"><b>MLP (or MoE experts)</b><span>each word processed alone; holds much of the knowledge</span></div>
      <div class="plus">+ added onto the running vector</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fb"><b>Unembedding</b><span>vector → one score per possible next token</span></div>
    <div class="fb"><b>Softmax + sampling</b><span>scores → probabilities → one chosen token</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
